{"1991460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ygg Engine", "steam_appid": 1991460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/e440f8ac2f0855f26db7ab7833d45379.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/7b7d3b8030e1f8deb324358085213d84.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=130 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/7b7d3b8030e1f8deb324358085213d84.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ygg Engine is a fantasy and adventure scenario engine with sandbox and large scale multiplayer features.<br>Explore an open-world with quests and leveling up skills. Or create a unique adventure for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> This time, magic has gone too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9bd636bc27a182129df114f3448f224d.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9bd636bc27a182129df114f3448f224d.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH MOBS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/eff7bb4e22afe6ef586d5a4fd661cfca.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/eff7bb4e22afe6ef586d5a4fd661cfca.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why not farm on some rats before you try your luck on a dragon? <br>Watch out, some monsters are aggressive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/6e55387d70a5608d3cefc30face6d16f.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/6e55387d70a5608d3cefc30face6d16f.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/30f3f3c43dc895a0842000c0355764a4.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/30f3f3c43dc895a0842000c0355764a4.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1569e75a4523f5b78571d2266a2ab295.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1569e75a4523f5b78571d2266a2ab295.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1569e75a4523f5b78571d2266a2ab295.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT RESOURCES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/faedd476ec7667762e2451dc94a27561.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/faedd476ec7667762e2451dc94a27561.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a2a94d28966f3727ed7a329f484b5204.webp?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a2a94d28966f3727ed7a329f484b5204.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/023232192d9f3e50c5c263525ba26efe.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/023232192d9f3e50c5c263525ba26efe.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collecting resources is easy enough from the safety provided by town walls.<br>Beware of venturing in the wilderness unprepared.<br>You may me fighting for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc3128300f40077e42e81b3815d31388.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc3128300f40077e42e81b3815d31388.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=155 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD STRUCTURES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your environment on demand! Building within towns can be limited by property ownership.<br>Players can buy, sell or lease plots within towns for item storage and other conveniences.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ed489f1b71fb98f85986f8d2806787fa.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ed489f1b71fb98f85986f8d2806787fa.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL SKILLS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Level up your combat and non-combat skills to discover new magic,<br>or money making strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/fb419f8f1d2bd55fe3fdc4aa1e9ccadb.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/fb419f8f1d2bd55fe3fdc4aa1e9ccadb.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS &amp; ARMOR!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ba55cdb7c6200084d11a316099b1d291.webp?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ba55cdb7c6200084d11a316099b1d291.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip yourself for your battles freely<br>Each piece of worn equipment from helmet to boots is on display<br>Armor and weapons provide different bonuses<br>Metal armor will slow a mage down, so mages avoid that</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1bb9fa5b0eb21bef302910558ecc8765.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1bb9fa5b0eb21bef302910558ecc8765.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUESTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Talk to those in need, they can assign quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f7596eef614b3a359790b31004f29c64.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f7596eef614b3a359790b31004f29c64.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=130 height=130 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat enemies, find secrets, solve mysteries, complete puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/8aadbc904dfb87d2e801dc04182a46f1.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/8aadbc904dfb87d2e801dc04182a46f1.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Acquire sweet, sweet lootations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/839fd5a442224d0ddac8a3574f73037b.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=180 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/839fd5a442224d0ddac8a3574f73037b.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNICAL DETAILS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ygg Engine includes a client, server, and editor<br>Ygg Engine runs as a client and server, which can be limited to single-player or opened for multi-player <br>Authoritative server design, actions are validated on the server to ensure fair gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c183b1014c2c4fdf2082c137f54c20b6.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c183b1014c2c4fdf2082c137f54c20b6.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Massive player counts and scaling is made possible by an over engineered back end making use of Spatial Hashes, R-trees, and other hyper efficient data structures and design patterns. Find out more in the developer documentation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">WE CALL THIS THE MEGANERD FLEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resolution: 640x480 (minimum); 1920x1080 or higher (recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Client consumes under 1 GB RAM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server consumes under ~500MB-1GB RAM</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage: Client file size and all caching is under 1 GB</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host OS: Windows, Linux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU: AMD64 and ARM support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9962c0e31c2a7014ea85a86bcc64915b.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9962c0e31c2a7014ea85a86bcc64915b.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/e440f8ac2f0855f26db7ab7833d45379.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/7b7d3b8030e1f8deb324358085213d84.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=130 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/7b7d3b8030e1f8deb324358085213d84.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ygg Engine is a fantasy and adventure scenario engine with sandbox and large scale multiplayer features.<br>Explore an open-world with quests and leveling up skills. Or create a unique adventure for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> This time, magic has gone too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9bd636bc27a182129df114f3448f224d.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9bd636bc27a182129df114f3448f224d.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH MOBS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/eff7bb4e22afe6ef586d5a4fd661cfca.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/eff7bb4e22afe6ef586d5a4fd661cfca.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why not farm on some rats before you try your luck on a dragon? <br>Watch out, some monsters are aggressive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/6e55387d70a5608d3cefc30face6d16f.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/6e55387d70a5608d3cefc30face6d16f.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/30f3f3c43dc895a0842000c0355764a4.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/30f3f3c43dc895a0842000c0355764a4.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1569e75a4523f5b78571d2266a2ab295.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1569e75a4523f5b78571d2266a2ab295.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1569e75a4523f5b78571d2266a2ab295.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT RESOURCES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/faedd476ec7667762e2451dc94a27561.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/faedd476ec7667762e2451dc94a27561.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a2a94d28966f3727ed7a329f484b5204.webp?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a2a94d28966f3727ed7a329f484b5204.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/023232192d9f3e50c5c263525ba26efe.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/023232192d9f3e50c5c263525ba26efe.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collecting resources is easy enough from the safety provided by town walls.<br>Beware of venturing in the wilderness unprepared.<br>You may me fighting for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc3128300f40077e42e81b3815d31388.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc3128300f40077e42e81b3815d31388.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=155 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD STRUCTURES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your environment on demand! Building within towns can be limited by property ownership.<br>Players can buy, sell or lease plots within towns for item storage and other conveniences.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ed489f1b71fb98f85986f8d2806787fa.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ed489f1b71fb98f85986f8d2806787fa.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL SKILLS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.mp4?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Level up your combat and non-combat skills to discover new magic,<br>or money making strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/fb419f8f1d2bd55fe3fdc4aa1e9ccadb.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/fb419f8f1d2bd55fe3fdc4aa1e9ccadb.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS &amp; ARMOR!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ba55cdb7c6200084d11a316099b1d291.webp?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ba55cdb7c6200084d11a316099b1d291.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip yourself for your battles freely<br>Each piece of worn equipment from helmet to boots is on display<br>Armor and weapons provide different bonuses<br>Metal armor will slow a mage down, so mages avoid that</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1bb9fa5b0eb21bef302910558ecc8765.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1bb9fa5b0eb21bef302910558ecc8765.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUESTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Talk to those in need, they can assign quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f7596eef614b3a359790b31004f29c64.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/f7596eef614b3a359790b31004f29c64.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=130 height=130 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat enemies, find secrets, solve mysteries, complete puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/8aadbc904dfb87d2e801dc04182a46f1.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/8aadbc904dfb87d2e801dc04182a46f1.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Acquire sweet, sweet lootations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/839fd5a442224d0ddac8a3574f73037b.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" width=180 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/839fd5a442224d0ddac8a3574f73037b.webm?t=1773449922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1773449922\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNICAL DETAILS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ygg Engine includes a client, server, and editor<br>Ygg Engine runs as a client and server, which can be limited to single-player or opened for multi-player <br>Authoritative server design, actions are validated on the server to ensure fair gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c183b1014c2c4fdf2082c137f54c20b6.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c183b1014c2c4fdf2082c137f54c20b6.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Massive player counts and scaling is made possible by an over engineered back end making use of Spatial Hashes, R-trees, and other hyper efficient data structures and design patterns. Find out more in the developer documentation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">WE CALL THIS THE MEGANERD FLEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resolution: 640x480 (minimum); 1920x1080 or higher (recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Client consumes under 1 GB RAM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server consumes under ~500MB-1GB RAM</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage: Client file size and all caching is under 1 GB</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host OS: Windows, Linux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU: AMD64 and ARM support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9962c0e31c2a7014ea85a86bcc64915b.apng?t=1773449922\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9962c0e31c2a7014ea85a86bcc64915b.poster.avif?t=1773449922\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fight monsters, level up skills, build structures, or casually live in a massive open-world. Join the public server or host your own and invite your friends to share an adventure.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/header.jpg?t=1773449922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773449922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773449922", "website": "https://www.yggengine.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Resolution min 640x480. Recommended 1920x1080 or higher</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Resolution min 640x480. Recommended: 1920x1080 or higher</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB availabl